{"v":4,"catch":"Cookulo：一款實驗性料理遊戲，你的任務是完成你的食譜書！","desc":"在這款輕鬆悠閒的遊戲中混搭食材，烹飪出美味料理。隨著你發現值得記錄的食譜，解鎖更多食材。發揮你的創意，運用食譜靈感或獨特的風味組合進行實驗，創造出驚喜料理！\n\n燒焦了料理？沒問題！烹飪就是不斷嘗試與錯誤的過程。超過 200 道可愛手繪料理等著你解鎖，樂趣無窮！","publisher":"Adrian Corpuz","release":"2024-12-05","genres":["模擬","益智"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","韓文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1ac8b839df79455caf8da3b37d804f0c63b753650fa810ae030c9973cf1de9a0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/eb3e66c4ae393d484a3a25fbafc7b4fa517d463ebf276380998128f6291caf4b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c883fefaacd197807cf1896e84ae8d4bc7178efe43f8b431cb5a9ecaa007fec0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c6bc24b3593a45020124e31d9a722e8644ea072bdf2d7d98efaa235b422adb64.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7fa07b957a701d73f34c3e7432e649cb040950e3db66c6502adac2cf52da50e5.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/841731a8126c5ff480521986df8731e1ac1d56ff1f05e2ea1803cc716e139055.jpg"],"titleId":"01002590210d8000","dlc":[]}